## Provenance and maintenance

- **Staleness rule:** re-stamp every "(verified <date>)" section at each milestone. A
  section you can no longer verify gets tombstoned in place ("STALE as of <date>: <why>"),
  not silently left standing. A dead section is deleted, not preserved.
- **Update triggers:** engine/framework submodule bump → Identity; new SDK or platform →
  Identity; new CI gate → Gates; milestone → Hardest live problem (rewrite) + all stamps;
  any deviation from a ck-game skill → Divergences table, same commit as the deviation.
- **Re-verify commands** (PowerShell, repo root):
  - Submodule pins: `git submodule status Plugins/CkFoundation Plugins/CkTests Plugins/CkGameplayDebugger CkAuto`
  - Engine pin: `Get-Content <engine-path>/Engine/Build/Build.version`
  - Maps exist: `Test-Path Content/<ProjectName>/<...>.umap` per Maps table row
  - Skill junctions live: `Get-ChildItem .claude/skills` (re-run sync-skills if empty)
- **Tooling caveat:** if this repo adopts the standard `.ignore` (hiding `Script/`,
  `Content/`, plugin `Script/` from ripgrep), the Grep/Glob tools silently return zero
  there — re-check zero-matches with `rg --no-ignore` before concluding absence.
